Z||000000||Patrick's Dad||05-23-2000||11:37 PM||||She was coming off the road anyway the end of the month. Inspection would have run out, and two kids can't fit in the passenger seat (Legally, anyhow). Saturday, she was feeling mousy (not the SB V8 kind), so, I pulled into a parking lot ant turned the wheel. I really need some lower ball joint work.... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroGarage.jpg"> <BR>So, no I have to drive my wife's Explorer, aka, the Mistake, around. I can't wait until my Valiant is on the road (Yes, a 1973 Valiant with a 5.2l V8).<P>But then, there's my Fiero.... Oh, well, She'll be happier when I'm done with her.... Details to follow....   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||9
